{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small industry. Buy and sell products, request shipments from your industries and hands-on load/unload pallets. Fulfill orders and reinvest profits to expand your business. Scale your operation from a small trader to full-fledged industrial empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase and upgrade industries to produce products.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade product production and price to maximize profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate market and control demand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase shares of rivals for passive income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your own way to the top.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hands-on Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate your forklift to manually load and unload pallets, move goods through your warehouse, and handle shipments yourself. Every decision matter: your hands-on actions impact your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Market</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The market reacts to supply and demand. Buy low, sell high, and watch prices fluctuate based on your and rival companies' actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Growth and Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your products and industries to increase efficiency and profit. Every upgrade opens new strategies and opportunities to dominate the market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple paths to success: focus on trading, production, or a balanced approach. No two runs play exactly the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge / Risk</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against AI rivals who will buy shares, manipulate markets, and expand their operations. Can you outsmart them and rise to the top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Outcomes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you go bankrupt or own 100% of all of your rivals?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Personal Skill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3143880/0211b09280d62f6f5f57a8fbd9655910f27085ab.jpg"},{"name":"Personal Skill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3143880/0211b09280d62f6f5f57a8fbd9655910f27085ab.jpg"},{"name":"Personal Skill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3143880/0211b09280d62f6f5f57a8fbd9655910f27085ab.jpg"},{"name":"Cargo Skill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3143880/7479d109149deaf091a73a1b2cac05f5ffe56e01.jpg"},{"name":"Cargo Skill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3143880/7479d109149deaf091a73a1b2cac05f5ffe56e01.jpg"},{"name":"Cargo Skill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3143880/7479d109149deaf091a73a1b2cac05f5ffe56e01.jpg"},{"name":"Cargo Skill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3143880/7479d109149deaf091a73a1b2cac05f5ffe56e01.jpg"},{"name":"Cargo Skill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3143880/7479d109149deaf091a73a1b2cac05f5ffe56e01.jpg"},{"name":"Cargo Skill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3143880/7479d109149deaf091a73a1b2cac05f5ffe56e01.jpg"},{"name":"Cargo Skill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3143880/cf21b4b198eb9f28d8bd266ef3abc6b3d7260907.jpg"}],"total":67},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3143880?t=1773082329","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143880/17634f2e7a876c